# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
title    Mines
composer Claude
about    Rails into the dark and crystals catching the lamp light: a flute and its echo in C Lydian (the raised F# glitters), vibraphone arpeggios, a glockenspiel spark, a soft synth pad and a fretless bass picking like a hammer. The second half turns to A minor. When something is near, a woodblock strikes like a pickaxe over low toms and a triangle; brass joins the fight, an organ and choir come for a guardian.
tempo    90
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.55

# moods (music/README.md)
# mood explore:  lead echo arp spark pad bass
# mood treasure: arp spark pad wonder
# mood sense:    block tri toms spark pad bass
# mood rise:     sense -spark lead echo arp kick snare
# mood fight:    rise -echo -tri -arp brass drive war crash
# mood boss:     fight -lead organ choir

voice lead     flute     vol=0.6  pan=-0.1 rev=0.5
voice echo     flute     vol=0.2  pan=0.5  rev=0.7
voice arp      vibes     vol=0.4  pan=0.3
voice spark    glock     vol=0.22 pan=0.45 rev=0.6
voice pad      pad       vol=0.22 pan=-0.25 center=E4 att=0.6 rel=1
voice bass     fretless  vol=0.7
voice wonder   celesta   vol=0.38 pan=-0.35 rev=0.6
voice block    block     vol=0.38 pan=0.35
voice tri      tri       vol=0.25 pan=-0.4
voice toms     tomlo     vol=0.5  pan=-0.2
voice kick     kick      vol=0.55
voice snare    snare     vol=0.36 pan=0.1
voice brass    brass     vol=0.43 pan=-0.25 gate=0.65 center=E4 att=0.018 rel=0.09 rev=0.22
voice crash    crash     vol=0.28 pan=0.2
voice organ    pipe      vol=0.3  pan=0.1  att=0.3 rel=0.8
voice choir    choir     vol=0.28 center=E4 att=0.5 rel=0.8

# Combat-only motion: tight low ostinato and accented battle drums, at the same tempo.
voice drive    pizz      vol=0.52 pan=0.3 gate=0.55 rev=0.25
voice war      tommid    vol=0.5  pan=-0.15 rev=0.2

